<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-9794] Registration of a binary type with POJO field under topology lock leads to UnregisteredBinaryTypeException</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9794</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Please find attached test class with a reproducer.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The exception was introduced in&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8926&quot; title=&quot;Deadlock in meta data registration&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8926&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8926&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Metadata registration should be retried when this exception is thrown,&#160;but it doesn&apos;t happen.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
